### What was Kyle Rittenhouse's exact date of birth, and was he 17 years old at the time of the alleged incidents in Kenosha, Wisconsin?
Answer: The search result confirms that Kyle Rittenhouse was a 17-year-old at the time of the alleged incidents in Kenosha on August 25, 2020, but it does not provide his exact date of birth.

